/*
 * Implements semantic validation for static field access on integer types
 * using the path operator `::`.
 *
 * Supported static fields:
 *   - init   — default integer initializer(0)
 *   - max    — maximum representable integer value for the type
 *   - min    — minimum representable integer value for the type
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::operator::path::int
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/operator/path/int.yr
